OL,3,GNEWSABonfire warning after large
OL,4,Awildfire breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders have been urged not to start
OL,7,Fbonfires after a wildfire the size of
OL,8,Fthree football pitches broke out.
OL,10,FGuernsey Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,11,Fcalled to the blaze near Rue C  Fresne
OL,12,Fin Castel earlier.
OL,14,FGuernsey Police advised people to avoid
OL,15,Fthe area while firefighters
OL,16,Fextinguished the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
