OL,3,GNEWSABonfire warning after large
OL,4,Awildfire breaks out
OL,5,
OL,6,FRory Quesnel, duty acting watch
OL,7,Fcommander, said crews tackled the
OL,8,Fflames quickly, adding: "Everything is
OL,9,Fjust so dry and I don't think people
OL,10,Fappreciate quite how fast something can
OL,11,Fget out of hand if you're doing a
OL,12,Fcontrolled burn."
